The water in the pot is already boiling.
I look at my phone again.
The chef in the video is very loud and cheerful.
"Then mix the minced meat with an egg and chopped onions!"
"Also take a wet bread roll and two tablespoons of mustard!"
I very happily follow the instructions.
I put all the ingredients into a large bowl.
I mix everything with my hands.
My hands get really sticky immediately.
But the kneading is a lot of fun.
The meat mixture is soon ready.
Afterwards, I form the meatballs.
I make them flat and round, just like in the video.
I put the finished meatballs on a plate.
Now I have to wash my hands quickly.
